\"></head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-4 opacity-0 book\" data-family=\"chapter-lesson\">\n  <section data-section-type=\"text_and_images\" data-section-id=\"pg012_sec001\" class=\"bg-white text-zinc-800 pb-8 overflow-x-hidden b-page\">\n    <div class=\"-mx-8 max-sm:-mx-4 bg-violet-500 b-banner\">\n      <div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-12 max-lg:px-10 max-sm:px-6 py-20 max-lg:py-16 max-sm:py-12\">\n        <h1 class=\"adt-h2 font-normal text-white max-w-3xl\" data-id=\"pg012_n0002\">Si kanë jetuar të parët tanë?</h1>\n        <h2 class=\"adt-h2 font-bold text-white max-w-3xl\" data-id=\"pg012_n0003\">Monumentet historike</h2>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mb-8 -mt-5 max-sm:mt-5\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-stretch rounded-[2rem] border-4 border-violet-500 bg-white overflow-hidden shadow-sm w-[86%] max-lg:w-full max-sm:flex-col\">\n        <div class=\"bg-violet-400 px-6 py-5 flex items-center shrink-0 min-w-[210px] max-sm:min-w-0 max-sm:w-full\">\n          <span class=\"adt-body font-bold text-white b-keyword-label\" data-id=\"pg012_n0005\">Fjalët kyçe:</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"px-6 py-5 flex items-center max-sm:items-start\">\n          <span class=\"adt-body\" data-id=\"pg012_n0006\">monument, simbol, gërmim, përmendore, arkiv.</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <aside class=\"mb-8 rounded-[2rem] bg-sky-300 px-8 py-6 max-sm:px-5 shadow-sm b-panel-thought\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 max-sm:block\">\n        <div class=\"shrink-0 w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-white/90 border border-zinc-300 shadow-sm mt-1 max-sm:mb-3\"></div>\n        <div class=\"flex-1\">\n          <h3 class=\"adt-h3 mb-4 font-medium text-zinc-800\" data-id=\"pg012_n0008\">Shpreh mendimin tënd</h3>\n          <p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed text-zinc-800\">\n            <span data-id=\"pg012_n0010\">- Kujto se çfarë ke mësuar për monumentet historike.</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg012_n0011\">Monumentet kulturore-historike janë ndërtime dhe vlera historike nga e kaluara dhe e sotmja.</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg012_n0012\">Në secilin vend ka monumente historike që tregojnë histori nga lashtësia e deri më sot.</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg012_n0013\">Ato e kanë të njëjtën vlerë, por dallojnë për nga ngjarja historike që tregojnë dhe mënyra e ndërtimit të tyre.</span>\n            <span data-id=\"pg012_n0014\">Disa nga to po i përmendim më poshtë:</span>\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[0.95fr_1.05fr] gap-8 items-start mb-10 max-lg:grid-cols-1 max-lg:gap-5\">\n      <figure class=\"w-full min-w-0\">\n        <img src=\"images/pg012_im005.png\" alt=\"Kalaja e Prizrenit\" data-id=\"pg012_im005\" class=\"block w-full max-w-full h-auto rounded-md shadow-md\">\n        <figcaption class=\"adt-caption mt-2 text-center italic text-zinc-700\" data-id=\"pg012_n0016\">Kalaja e Prizrenit</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n      <p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed min-w-0\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg012_n0018\">Kjo kala i ka fillet e saj në periudhën e parë të qytetërimit të këtij rajoni, në parahistori.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg012_n0019\">Është e vendosur në pjesën lindore të qytetit, mbi një kodër në formë konike, e rrethuar me mure mbrojtëse.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg012_n0020\">Kalaja e Prizrenit përmban pjesë të rëndësishme të historisë së lashtë të qytetit.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg012_n0021\">Është vend interesant për vizitorët e vendit dhe të huaj.</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-4xl\">\n      <span data-id=\"pg012_n0023\">“Ura e Fshajtë” ose “Ura e Shenjtë” është një urë guri e shekullit XVIII, me një hark mbi kanionin e lumit Drini i Bardhë.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"flex justify-end mb-10 max-lg:block\">\n      <figure class=\"w-[38%] min-w-0 max-lg:w-full\">\n        <img src=\"images/pg012_im002.png\" alt=\"Ura e Fshajtë\" data-id=\"pg012_im002\" class=\"block w-full max-w-full h-auto rounded-md shadow-md\">\n        <figcaption class=\"adt-caption mt-2 text-center italic text-zinc-700\" data-id=\"pg012_n0025\">Ura e Fshajtë</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[0.95fr_1.05fr] gap-8 items-start mb-10 max-lg:grid-cols-1 max-lg:gap-5\">\n      <figure class=\"w-full min-w-0\">\n        <img src=\"images/pg012_im003.png\" alt=\"Shtëpia e Lidhjes së Prizrenit\" data-id=\"pg012_im003\" class=\"block w-full max-w-full h-auto rounded-md shadow-md\">\n        <figcaption class=\"adt-caption mt-2 text-center italic text-zinc-700\" data-id=\"pg012_n0027\">Shtëpia e Lidhjes së Prizrenit</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n      <p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed min-w-0\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg012_n0029\">Më 10 qershor të vitit 1878, në Prizren u mblodhën shqiptarë nga të gjitha viset shqiptare.</span>\n        <span data-id=\"pg012_n0030\">Ata formuan “Lidhjen Shqiptare të Prizrenit”, e cila kishte për qëllim dëbimin e pushtuesve dhe krijimin e shtetit të pavarur shqiptar.</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1fr_1fr] gap-8 items-start max-lg:grid-cols-1 max-lg:gap-5\">\n      <p class=\"adt-body leading-relaxed min-w-0\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg012_n0032\">Kompleksi Memorial “Adem Jashari” ndodhet në Prekaz, ku gjenden shtëpitë, tashmë të shndërruara në muze, si dhe të gjitha varret e të rënëve në luftë të familjes Jashari.</span>\n      </p>\n      <figure class=\"w-full min-w-0\">\n        <img src=\"images/pg012_im004.png\" alt=\"Kompleksi Memorial Adem Jashari\" data-id=\"pg012_im004\" class=\"block w-full max-w-full h-auto rounded-md shadow-md\">\n        <figcaption class=\"adt-caption mt-2 text-center italic text-zinc-700\" data-id=\"pg012_n0034\">Kompleksi Memorial “Adem Jashari”</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js?v=9f3d745a858de581\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n\n\n\n<script src=\"./book-design/responses.js?v=9f3d745a858de581\" data-book-responses=\"true\"></script></body></html>","./pg014_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe mjedisi</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg014_sec001\">\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"17\">\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"./book-design/components.css?v=9f3d745a858de581\" data-book-style=\"true\"></head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl bg-white opacity-0 book\" data-family=\"response\">\n  <section data-section-type=\"other\" data-section-id=\"pg014_sec001\" role=\"region\" class=\"relative min-h-screen overflow-hidden bg-white b-page\">\n    <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 h-full w-24 bg-orange-300 max-sm:w-[4.5rem]\"><