class=\"flex gap-4 items-start max-sm:flex-col\">\n      <div class=\"w-[34%] max-sm:w-full shrink-0\">\n        <img data-id=\"pg025_im002\" src=\"images/pg025_im002.png\" alt=\"Kasolle\" class=\"w-full h-auto shadow-sm\">\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"adt-body text-left leading-relaxed flex-1 pt-1\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg025_n0017\">Kasolle është quajtur në të kaluarën ndërtesa e thjeshtë përdhese (shtëpi e thjeshtë), që ka shërbyer për banim.</span> <span data-id=\"pg025_n0018\">Kasollja ka qenë e ndërtuar nga gardhi, e lyer brenda e jashtë me baltë të përzier me kashtë, kurse çatinë e kishte të mbuluar me tallë misri ose me kashtë.</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"flex gap-4 items-start max-sm:flex-col\">\n      <div class=\"w-[35%] max-sm:w-full shrink-0\">\n        <img data-id=\"pg025_im003\" src=\"images/pg025_im003.png\" alt=\"Shtëpi përdhese tradicionale\" class=\"w-full h-auto shadow-sm\">\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"adt-body text-left leading-relaxed flex-1 pt-1\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg025_n0020\">Me kalimin e kohës u ndërtuan shtëpitë përdhese me arkitekturë të thjeshtë popullore.</span> <span data-id=\"pg025_n0021\">Ato u ndërtuan me material të fortë prej qerpiçësh.</span> <span data-id=\"pg025_n0022\">Shtëpia kishte zakonisht mbulojën e gjatë, që ishte vazhdimi i shtëpisë, i quajtur hajat.</span> <span data-id=\"pg025_n0023\">Secila shtëpi kishte një dhomë më të madhe se të tjerat, që ishte dhoma e ndenjjes.</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"flex gap-4 items-start max-sm:flex-col\">\n      <div class=\"w-[29%] max-sm:w-full shrink-0\">\n        <img data-id=\"pg025_im004\" src=\"images/pg025_im004.png\" alt=\"Shtëpi tradicionale me kate\" class=\"w-full h-auto shadow-sm\">\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"adt-body text-left leading-relaxed flex-1 pt-4 max-sm:pt-0\">\n        <span data-id=\"pg025_n0025\">Shtëpitë tradicionale me kate ishin, të njohura në Kosovë.</span> <span data-id=\"pg025_n0026\">Ato ndërtoheshin nga familjet e mëdha.</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js?v=9f3d745a858de581\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n\n\n\n<script src=\"./book-design/responses.js?v=9f3d745a858de581\" data-book-responses=\"true\"></script></body></html>","./pg026_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe mjedisi</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg026_sec001\">\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"42\">\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"./book-design/components.css?v=9f3d745a858de581\" data-book-style=\"true\"></head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container opacity-0 book\" data-family=\"illustrated-lesson\"><section data-section-type=\"text_and_images\" data-section-id=\"pg026_sec001\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 py-8 max-sm:px-5 b-page\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] items-start gap-8 max-lg:grid-cols-1\"><div><img data-id=\"pg026_im001\" src=\"images/pg026_im001.png\" al