ax-sm:px-5 max-sm:pt-4 max-sm:pb-5\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-5 max-sm:gap-4 max-sm:flex-col\"><div class=\"h-[7.8rem] w-[7.8rem] shrink-0 rounded-[1.4rem] bg-purple-300/80 max-lg:h-[7rem] max-lg:w-[7rem] max-sm:h-[5.6rem] max-sm:w-[5.6rem] b-rubric-wrapper\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"images/pg005_im003.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"b-rubric-icon\"></div><div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0 pt-2 max-sm:pt-0\"><h1 class=\"adt-h2 text-left font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4 max-sm:mb-3\" data-id=\"pg033_n0023\">Thello dijet</h1><p class=\"adt-body text-left leading-[1.9] text-gray-800\"><span data-id=\"pg033_n0025\">Veshja tradicionale është një nga tiparet që e dallon një komb nga kombet e tjera.</span> <span data-id=\"pg033_n0026\">Veshjet tradicionale ekzistojnë që nga periudha ilire.</span> <span data-id=\"pg033_n0027\">Simbolet dhe motivet themelore me të cilat janë disenjuar këto veshje u ngjajnë veshjeve ilire.</span> <span data-id=\"pg033_n0028\">Materialet që përdoren për krijimin e këtyre rrobave janë të thurura.</span> <span data-id=\"pg033_n0029\">Kryesisht, këto rroba kanë tri ngjyra kryesore: të bardhë, të zezë dhe të kuqe (e cila është më simbolikja).</span> <span data-id=\"pg033_n0030\">Veshjet tradicionale në Kosovë dallohen sipas krahinave, si: veshja e Dukagjinit, e Hasit, e Llapit, e Rugovës, e Opojës, e Karadakut e të tjera.</span> <span data-id=\"pg033_n0031\">Në ditët e sotme, në Kosovë veshjet tradicionale përdoren në jetën artistike e kulturore dhe në festa të ndryshme familjare.</span> <span data-id=\"pg033_n0032\">Ato ruhen edhe në muze si dëshmi kulturore për vendin tonë.</span></p></div></div></div></div></section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js?v=9f3d745a858de581\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n\n\n\n<script src=\"./book-design/responses.js?v=9f3d745a858de581\" data-book-responses=\"true\"></script></body></html>","./pg033_sec004.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe mjedisi</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg033_sec004\">\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"66\">\n    <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"./book-design/components.css?v=9f3d745a858de581\" data-book-style=\"true\"></head>\n\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <main class=\"w-full\">\n      <div id=\"content\" class=\"container opacity-0 book\" data-family=\"reference\"><section data-section-type=\"boxed_text\" data-section-id=\"pg033_sec004\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 py-8 max-sm:px-4 b-page\"><div class=\"flex items-stretch overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border-2 border-[#b98ad1] bg-[#d9c7e3] shadow-sm max-sm:flex-col\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex w-40 shrink-0 items-center justify-center bg-[#b287c6] px-4 py-4 max-sm:w-full max-sm:justify-center max-sm:py-3 b-rubric-wrapper\"><img src=\"images/pg005_im001.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"b-rubric-icon\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 items-center px-6 py-5 max-sm:px-5 max-sm:py-4\"><div class=\"w-full\"><h1 class=\"adt-h3 mb-3 text-[#2f1f39]\" data-id=\"pg033_n0035\">Fjalort